91
00:03:47,315 --> 00:03:49,847
Now, we can absolutely access by key name.

92
00:03:50,232 --> 00:03:52,684
So we could enter firstName here like this.

93
00:03:53,341 --> 00:03:55,969
This is a string key name. We don't have the

