00:03:58,212 --> 00:04:00,808
as adding quotes. You just can omit it.

96
00:04:01,033 --> 00:04:03,004
That's simply an extra convenience you have

97
00:04:03,100 --> 00:04:05,648
built into JavaScript. But this is a string

98
00:04:05,744 --> 00:04:08,102
