152
00:06:14,687 --> 00:06:16,984
this shorthand syntax here for adding such a

153
00:06:16,984 --> 00:06:17,310
method.

154
00:06:19,323 --> 00:06:21,996
There, for example, I could console.log Hi,

155
00:06:22,513 --> 00:06:22,964
I am

156
00:06:25,982 --> 00:06:26,127
this

157
00:06:27,677 --> 00:06:28,209
firstName.

158
00:06:28,984 --> 00:06:31,001
And this would print, Hi, I am Max, if we

159
00:06:31,066 --> 00:06:33,890
execute person.greet like this.

160
00:06:34,697 --> 00:06:35,165
So with this,

161
00:06:35,762 --> 00:06:37,779
we execute this function and therefore we

162
00:06:37,779 --> 00:06:39,344
